# Code owners for Skillbox
#
# Syntax: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# TODO(SBX-018): Assign real owners.
#
# No ownership entries are defined yet because no GitHub user or team has been
# provided for this repository. Inventing a handle would create a CODEOWNERS
# file that silently fails to request reviews, which is worse than an empty one.
#
# When an owner exists, add entries below and enable "Require review from Code
# Owners" in branch protection. Suggested starting point:
#
#   *                          @OWNER
#   /packages/schema/          @OWNER
#   /packages/core/            @OWNER
#   /packages/cli/             @OWNER
#   /registry/                 @OWNER
#   /docs/architecture/        @OWNER
#   /.github/workflows/        @OWNER
#
# Paths worth requiring extra review on, because a mistake there is expensive:
#
#   /packages/core/src/paths.ts        Security boundary: path containment
#   /packages/core/src/apply.ts        Filesystem mutation and rollback
#   /packages/core/src/lockfile.ts     Lockfile determinism
#   /docs/architecture/decisions/      Architectural decision records
#   /docs/architecture/security-model.md
